title: Reconstruction policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 12; month_actions += 1; nationalize_budget = 4; nationalize_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 2; nationalize_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 3; nationalize_budget -= 1 if socializations + nationalization_progress >= 2; wtb_budget = 4; wtb_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 2 or socializations >= 1 or pro_labor >= 2
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and (economic_minister_party == "KCP" or finance_minister_party == "KCP") and economic_policy_timer <= 0 and economic_plan > 0
card-image: img/kcp_vynaria.png
#subtitle: Policies for the reconstruction of Vynaria.

= Economic Policy

We have already formulated an economic plan. Now we have to implement it.

- @wtb_2
- @wtb_2_deficit
- @wtb_continuation
- @implement_wtb_no_deficit
- @implement_wtb_deficit
- @moderate_plan
- @moderate_plan_limited_budget
- @root: Do not implement the economic plan.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@wtb_2
title: Continue the implementation of the Yoakumaen reconstruction.
subtitle: -3 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Unemployment has lowered , housing has been provided. The Yoakumaen culture flourishes and the city can thrive on its own now.
view-if: wtb_implemented > 2 and budget >= 3 
choose-if: unemployed > 8
on-arrival: works_program += 1; budget -= 3; workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent); workers += 1 if works_program <= 4; unemployed -= 3 if unemployed > 8; unemployed_kcp += 7*(1-dissent); workers_kcp += 3; workers_vnpf -= 3; wtb_implemented += 1; up_relation -= 5 if in_left_front; inflation += 2; economic_growth += 1.6; economic_growth -= 0.6 if economic_growth > 5

[? if works_program == 4 : We have commenced the second phase of our reconstruction. ?][? if works_program > 4 :  We have continued the reconstruction plan. ?] In addition to housing , small businesses and vital infrastructure, we are now focusing on rebuilding our industries.


@wtb_2_deficit
title: Continue the reconstruction of Vynaria.
subtitle: -3 budget - we will enter a deficit.
unavailable-subtitle: Unemployment has lowered , housing has been provided. The Yoakumaen culture flourishes and the city can thrive on its own now.
view-if: wtb_implemented > 2 and budget < 3 and budget >= -3
choose-if: unemployed > 10
on-arrival: works_program += 1; budget -= 3; workers_kcp += 6*(1-dissent); workers += 1 if works_program <= 4; unemployed -= 3 if unemployed > 8; unemployed_kcp += 6*(1-dissent); workers_up -= 2; workers_hp -= 4; workers_vnpf -= 2; coalition_dissent += 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; wtb_implemented += 1; inflation += 3; economic_growth += 1.6; economic_growth -= 0.6 if economic_growth > 5

We are continuing the reconstruction plan according to our grandiose design despite the require deficit spending.

@wtb_continuation
title: Look back at the progress so far...
view-if: wtb_implemented >= 1 and wtb_implemented <= 2
on-arrival: budget += 1 if works_program <= 2; unemployed -= 5 if (works_program <= 2 and unemployed > 15) else unemployed -= 3; unemployed += 3 if unemployed < 5; unemployed += 3 if unemployed < 0; workers += 2 if works_program <= 2 else workers += 1; workers_kcp += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 8*(1-dissent); workers_hp -= 3; workers_vnpf -= 5; works_program += 1; inflation += 1.5; inflation += 1 if unemployed < 10; economic_growth += 1.2; economic_growth -= 0.5 if economic_growth > 5

The city is begining to take shape. The new local Yoakumaen culture is thriving. However all comes at a cost and the "traditional" Vynarians left below the mountain in now growingly poorer parts of the city are grumbling about cultural erasure and replacement. Hard times ahead but we have gained a loyal support base which will prove vital for future elections.

[? if in_left_front: Moriarty comments to Annastasia one day that "This Yoakumaen experiment has gonne too far." ?]

@implement_wtb_no_deficit
title: Begin reconstruction!
subtitle: -[+ wtb_budget +] budget. [? if wtb_budget == 3 : Our pro-labor policies have reduced the cost of the plan. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: The city is already reconstructed. We missed our moment.
view-if: wtb_implemented == 0 and wtb_adopted == 1
choose-if: unemployed > 8
on-arrival: budget -= wtb_budget; works_program += 1; unemployed -= 4; workers_kcp += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 8*(1-dissent); wtb_implemented += 1; up_relation -= 5 if in_left_front; inflation += 2; economic_growth += 2.8; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent);
achievement: wirtschaftspolitik

We have started to enact the WTB plan. Money is beginning to flow through the economy via investments in large-scale public works.

[? if in_left_front: Moriarty is very forthcoming and passionate about the Yoakumaen culture. He himself is one of the first to become a Yoakumaen in Kaddu. This wont last. ?]

#######################################
# Traditionalist Reconstruction

@moderate_plan
title: Begin reconstruction along traditionalist lines
subtitle: -2 budget.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget. [? if budget < 2 : We do not have the necessary budget. ?] [? if unemployed < 8 : Unemployment is low enough that job creation is not necessary. ?]
view-if: moderate_plan_adopted == 1
choose-if: budget >= 2 and unemployed >= 8
on-arrival: budget -= 2; works_program += 1; unemployed -= 3 if unemployed >= 8; inflation += 1.5; workers_kcp += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); moderate_plan_progress += 1; inflation += 1 if unemployed < 10; vnpf_relation += 30 ; economic_growth += 1.6; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent);
achievement: wirtschaftspolitik

[? if moderate_plan_progress == 1 : We have begun the reconstruction of Vynaria looking at the original architecture and culture of local people! ?]

[? if moderate_plan_progress > 1 : We are begining to see a renesaince of local culture and infrastructure is rising considerably even if in low quality. ?]

[? if unemployed >= 10 : The destruction was immense and we reap the rewards of being the ones to start fixing it. ?]

[? if unemployed < 10 : The crisis has mostly abated and the reconstruction doesnt have the impact we wished for. ?]

@moderate_plan_limited_budget
title: Partially begin reconstruction to avoid a deficit.
subtitle: -1 budget.
unavailable-subtitle: -1 budget. [? if budget < 1 : We do not have the necessary budget. ?] [? if unemployed < 8 : The city is already reconstructed. We missed our moment. ?]
view-if: moderate_plan_adopted == 1
choose-if: budget >= 1 and unemployed >= 8
on-arrival: budget -= 1; works_program += 1; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 8; inflation += 1; workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 1*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 1*(1-dissent); moderate_plan_progress += 1 ; inflation += 1 if unemployed < 10; economic_growth += 0.7; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); vnpf_relation +=20;

[? if moderate_plan_progress == 1 : We have begun the reconstruction of Vynaria looking at the original architecture and culture of local people! ?]

[? if moderate_plan_progress > 1 : We are begining to see a renesaince of local culture and infrastructure is rising considerably even if in low quality. ?]

[? if unemployed >= 10 : The destruction was immense and we reap the rewards of being the ones to start fixing it. ?]

[? if unemployed < 10 : The crisis has mostly abated and the reconstruction doesnt have the impact we wished for. ?]


